            "description": "<div class=\"rich_media_content\"><section data-id=\"167926\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;caret-color:#000000;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;max-width:100%;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;visibility:visible;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><section style=\"margin:10px auto;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;visibility:visible;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><section style=\"-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;transform:rotateZ(0deg);visibility:visible;width:9em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><section style=\"background-color:#ffd785;border-radius:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:4px;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"border-radius:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;overflow:hidden;padding:0px;visibility:visible;width:145px;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OV2TY2SAXrGnHHwT6VjLnomvyGq4cMg6ZAAmyM-8kVV9EAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OV2TY2SAXrGnHHwT6VjLnomvyGq4cMg6ZAAmyM-8kVV9EAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;box-sizing:border-box;display:block;margin:0px;outline:0px;overflow-wrap:break-word;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;visibility:visible;width:145px;height:100%\"/></section></section><section style=\"-moz-transform:rotate(45deg);-o-transform:rotate(45deg);-webkit-transform:rotate(45deg);background-color:#ffd785;box-sizing:border-box;clip-path:polygon(0px 0px, 100% 50%, 0px 100%);height:20px;margin:-27px 5px 0px auto;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;transform:rotate(45deg);visibility:visible;width:20px;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><p style=\"clear:both;margin:0px;max-width:100%;min-height:1em;outline:0px;padding:0px;visibility:visible;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"visibility:visible\"><br/></span></p></section></section><section style=\"background-color:#f9f7f4;box-sizing:border-box;margin:-60px 0px 0px 35px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:14px 15px 10px;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><section style=\"margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:right;visibility:visible;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;visibility:visible;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><section style=\"color:#94472d;font-size:14px;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:center;visibility:visible;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><strong style=\"margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;visibility:visible;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;visibility:visible;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;visibility:visible;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"visibility:visible\">分享两篇报告</span></span></span></strong></section><section style=\"background-color:#ffd785;box-sizing:border-box;height:4px;margin:4px auto 0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;visibility:visible;width:25px;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><p style=\"clear:both;margin:0px;max-width:100%;min-height:1em;outline:0px;padding:0px;visibility:visible;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"visibility:visible\"><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"background-color:transparent;box-sizing:border-box;color:#5b443c;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:1.5px;line-height:1.75em;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:10px 0px 0px;text-align:justify;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><p style=\"clear:both;line-height:1.5em;margin:0px 0px 16px;max-width:100%;min-height:1em;outline:0px;padding:0px;visibility:visible;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"visibility:visible\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"clear:both;line-height:1.5em;margin:0px 0px 16px;max-width:100%;min-height:1em;outline:0px;padding:0px;visibility:visible;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;caret-color:red;font-size:13px;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;visibility:visible;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;visibility:visible;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"visibility:visible\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">大家好，我是丁祖昱。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;visibility:visible\"><strong style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:transparent;caret-color:#000000;color:#5b443c;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:1.5px;line-height:1.75em;max-width:100%;orphans:2;outline:0px;text-align:justify;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;visibility:visible;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"visibility:visible\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">这轮\"828\"新政，别只盯着房贷能贷到40年。</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;visibility:visible\"><strong style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:transparent;caret-color:#000000;color:#5b443c;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:1.5px;line-height:1.75em;max-width:100%;orphans:2;outline:0px;text-align:justify;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;visibility:visible;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"visibility:visible\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">8份文件同日落地，住建、央行、金融监管总局、证监会一起出手——这不是又一轮救市，是1998年房改以来最彻底的一次规则重写。现房销售制、项目公司制、主办银行制三件事同步推，等于把\"预售款拿地—再预售—再拿地\"这台跑了二十年的高周转引擎，直接拆了。</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;visibility:visible\"><strong style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:transparent;caret-color:#000000;color:#5b443c;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:1.5px;line-height:1.75em;max-width:100%;orphans:2;outline:0px;text-align:justify;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;visibility:visible;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"visibility:visible\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">我的核心判断就两句：</span></span><span style=\"visibility:visible\"><strong style=\"visibility:visible\"><span style=\"visibility:visible\">短期冲击有限</span></strong></span><span style=\"visibility:visible\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">——二手房已担起主要供应，新房供给也主动收缩三年，供应断档的担忧在数据面前站不住；</span></span><span style=\"visibility:visible\"><strong style=\"visibility:visible\"><span style=\"visibility:visible\">长期逻辑彻底重构</span></strong></span><span style=\"visibility:visible\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">——钱从看主体信用转向看项目现金流，房企的护城河从融资能力和周转速度，换成产品力与运营力。</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;visibility:visible\"><strong style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:transparent;caret-color:#000000;color:#5b443c;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:1.5px;line-height:1.75em;max-width:100%;orphans:2;outline:0px;text-align:justify;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;visibility:visible;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"visibility:visible\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">想看懂未来五年这个行业怎么走，这两篇普睿研究的研报建议连着读完。</span></span><span style=\"visibility:visible\"><strong style=\"visibility:visible\"><span style=\"visibility:visible\">旧的标尺已经失效，新的标尺正在立起来。</span></strong></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;caret-color:#000000;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px;max-width:100%;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;visibility:visible;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><section data-id=\"159766\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" style=\"margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;visibility:visible;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px auto;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;visibility:visible;width:50px;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><svg aria-label=\"插图\" role=\"img\" style=\"display:block;visibility:visible\" viewbox=\"0 0 72.52 73.32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g data-name=\"图层 2\" style=\"visibility:visible\"><g data-name=\"图层 1\" style=\"visibility:visible\"><path d=\"M70,.32s2.09,12.81-2.1,24.39c-8.11,22.46-36.58,19.63-41.14,8.72s12-19.95,19.41-5.74C54.25,43.21,33.74,64.73,2,59.32\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:#333333;stroke-w